WEBVTT

00:04.840 --> 00:07.500
Ryu, drop down a bit lower.

00:09.800 --> 00:13.710
If I'm guessing right, 
we should find her soon.

00:20.190 --> 00:21.450
I was right.

00:30.210 --> 00:31.710
Miss Alicia?

00:32.350 --> 00:33.450
Miss Alicia!

00:39.250 --> 00:41.610
Miss Alicia, it's me.

00:45.100 --> 00:47.850
M-Miss Yumiella, it's you...

00:48.960 --> 00:52.410
What am I doing... way out here?

00:53.350 --> 00:54.950
You don't remember?

01:25.200 --> 01:28.850
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

01:25.660 --> 01:28.850
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

02:32.320 --> 02:33.800
I see...

02:34.550 --> 02:37.570
You came all this way looking for me 
because you were worried about me?

02:38.880 --> 02:42.290
Since I told you about the 
dungeon in Varias yesterday,

02:42.290 --> 02:43.850
I thought maybe you...

02:43.850 --> 02:47.410
You didn't seem thrilled with 
the idea at the time, but...

02:47.720 --> 02:48.730
Yes...

02:48.730 --> 02:52.440
But what you said was exactly right.

02:52.440 --> 02:55.460
I can't keep holding Ed and 
the others back forever.

02:56.060 --> 02:58.240
I didn't know what to do.

02:58.450 --> 02:59.930
And you were so stressed over it,

02:59.930 --> 03:03.860
your feet carried you this far before 
you even realized you were moving?

03:05.340 --> 03:10.430
Actually, this has happened 
to me a few times before.

03:10.430 --> 03:11.870
It has?

03:12.140 --> 03:14.890
I'm just... doing things 
I never imagined doing

03:14.890 --> 03:16.930
without even realizing it.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.190
The first time was

03:20.190 --> 03:23.930
right after I received the Royal 
Academy's recommendation to enroll.

03:24.700 --> 03:28.560
They'd heard a rumor that 
I could use light magic,

03:28.560 --> 03:31.270
so the school sent someone 
to recruit me in person...

03:33.040 --> 03:36.250
But I said I couldn't and turned them down.

03:37.440 --> 03:40.370
But then, as I listened to him talk,

03:40.370 --> 03:43.820
I was overcome by the feeling that 
I needed to enter the academy...

03:45.120 --> 03:48.960
and the next thing I knew, 
I was signing the paperwork.

03:51.510 --> 03:55.260
It also happened at last year's 
martial arts competition,

03:55.260 --> 03:57.510
after you gave me advice.

03:58.730 --> 04:02.020
I had only a vague image 
of the spell in my head,

04:02.020 --> 04:06.570
but when it was my turn, the spell's 
name suddenly came to me...

04:06.970 --> 04:08.250
Sun Rain!

04:09.140 --> 04:11.580
It was like my body acted
of its own free will.

04:13.350 --> 04:15.160
Even I didn't understand it.

04:16.450 --> 04:19.780
And then, before the party at 
the end of the school year,

04:19.780 --> 04:22.330
I invited Ed outside without realizing it.

04:23.470 --> 04:25.110
I remember that.

04:25.110 --> 04:28.760
The other two boys were making a 
fuss because you two were gone.

04:29.540 --> 04:32.620
I actually asked a prince 
to leave a party with me!

04:32.620 --> 04:36.080
How was I even able to do something so bold?

04:36.880 --> 04:40.890
I do remember doing these things,

04:40.890 --> 04:44.380
but it's like... it wasn't me doing them.

04:44.770 --> 04:47.720
It's as if something was spurring me on...

04:48.150 --> 04:49.910
Have you told anyone about this?

04:51.870 --> 04:54.440
I haven't told Ed or the other boys.

04:54.440 --> 04:56.820
It would only make them worry.

04:57.510 --> 05:00.270
I considered talking to a teacher about it,

05:00.790 --> 05:03.030
but it seemed to have stopped 
happening recently...

05:03.530 --> 05:07.350
<i>I see. I've pretty much got the idea now.</i>

05:07.350 --> 05:10.410
<i>Looks like my hypothesis was on the mark.</i>

05:10.410 --> 05:19.670
Alicia

05:10.410 --> 05:19.670
We'll all fight together and defeat the Demon Lord!

05:10.810 --> 05:13.190
<i>This world is basically </i>Light and Hero<i>.</i>

05:13.190 --> 05:14.750
<i>In other words,</i>

05:14.750 --> 05:17.870
<i>it's nearly identical to the world of 
the otome game </i>Light Magic and the Hero<i>.</i>

05:17.870 --> 05:19.670
<i>And Alicia is the heroine of that game.</i>

05:19.670 --> 05:22.420
Alicia

05:19.670 --> 05:22.420
So this is the Royal Academy...

05:20.640 --> 05:22.420
<i>Her enrollment in the Royal Academy...</i>

05:22.420 --> 05:25.300
Alicia

05:22.420 --> 05:25.300
Sun Rain!

05:22.920 --> 05:25.300
<i>Her performance in the 
martial arts competition...</i>

05:25.300 --> 05:33.560
Edwin

05:25.300 --> 05:33.560
Alicia, let's go someplace where we can be alone.

05:26.010 --> 05:28.650
<i>Her leaving the party with one 
of the conquerable characters...</i>

05:29.210 --> 05:32.850
<i>They're all events that are 
necessary to advancing the story.</i>

05:33.560 --> 05:36.900
<i>At those times, Alicia almost 
automatically acts in accordance</i>

05:36.900 --> 05:39.800
<i>with the </i>Light and Hero<i> storyline.</i>

05:39.800 --> 05:44.400
<i>Essentially, she's doing what the 
game's plot compels her to do.</i>

05:45.570 --> 05:50.250
<i>Leveling up is another thing that's 
essential for beating the Demon Lord.</i>

05:50.810 --> 05:54.250
<i>Clearly, the plot kicked in again this time</i>

05:54.250 --> 05:56.790
<i>and compelled Alicia to move.</i>

05:57.340 --> 06:01.480
<i>I guess it's pretty tough 
to be the heroine, too.</i>

06:02.810 --> 06:05.420
<i>But there's no need for me to tell her that.</i>

06:06.170 --> 06:08.650
<i>She wouldn't get it, and 
it would only confuse her.</i>

06:10.020 --> 06:14.300
You must be someone with a strong 
sense of responsibility, Miss Alicia.

06:14.300 --> 06:15.310
Huh?

06:15.310 --> 06:18.590
Between that and how conscientious you are,

06:18.590 --> 06:20.940
you get so stressed that 
your body acts on its own.

06:21.370 --> 06:23.820
I think it was just raw 
talent that allowed you

06:23.820 --> 06:26.420
to use that spell you'd never used before.

06:26.420 --> 06:27.970
Really?

06:28.830 --> 06:32.060
Besides, they say young people like you

06:32.060 --> 06:35.240
are unbalanced in both mind and body.

06:35.240 --> 06:38.820
I'm sure your unconscious 
actions will stop in time.

06:39.190 --> 06:41.830
Aren't you still young 
yourself, Miss Yumiella?

06:41.830 --> 06:43.320
<i>Oh, right!</i>

06:49.350 --> 06:52.350
Still, I feel a bit better now.

06:52.990 --> 06:54.780
Thank you!

06:54.780 --> 06:56.600
<i>That heroine smile!</i>

06:56.920 --> 06:59.190
Now, I need to hurry back!

06:59.190 --> 07:01.580
Ed and the others are worried about me!

07:01.580 --> 07:03.480
Actually, before that...

07:04.330 --> 07:08.610
Since we're here, let's do just 
a bit of leveling in the dungeon.

07:08.610 --> 07:10.610
What? Right now?

07:11.850 --> 07:13.070
Of course.

07:15.170 --> 07:16.990
I have my Amulet of Protection.

07:16.990 --> 07:20.930
Once you try it, you'll 
see how much fun it is.

07:20.930 --> 07:23.500
Y-You think so?

07:23.500 --> 07:26.990
You'll be fine. I'll be right there with you.

07:28.230 --> 07:30.100
R-Right...

07:32.930 --> 07:37.100
This dungeon is dangerous,
even for Royal Academy students.

07:37.100 --> 07:38.500
You need permission to enter.

07:38.890 --> 07:39.930
It's all right.

07:40.620 --> 07:43.030
Come on, Ryu. Help us ask them.

07:54.920 --> 07:57.740
What happened? Did some 
urgent business come up?

07:57.740 --> 07:59.470
I don't think that's it...

08:06.690 --> 08:12.130
<b>The Hidden Boss Enters a Dungeon</b>

08:31.280 --> 08:33.030
If there are monsters all around you,

08:33.520 --> 08:35.730
you can hit a target dead-on 
even without aiming.

08:36.110 --> 08:37.530
Easy, right?

08:38.170 --> 08:39.280
Easy?!

08:39.490 --> 08:41.290
You call this easy?!

08:41.290 --> 08:45.020
The more monsters you kill,
the more your level will go up.

08:45.020 --> 08:48.310
Monsters of the dark attribute 
are weak to light magic,

08:48.310 --> 08:50.300
so you can just have fun mowing them down.

08:50.770 --> 08:53.270
This is not fun! This is <i>not</i> fun!

08:53.270 --> 08:56.680
Help me! Grandma!

08:56.680 --> 09:00.970
<i>I conquered this dungeon multiple times 
in the game, so I know I won't get lost.</i>

09:01.670 --> 09:04.290
<i>But Alicia is new to dungeons.</i>

09:04.290 --> 09:07.230
<i>I should do her the service 
of guiding her through it.</i>

09:07.600 --> 09:10.350
Miss Alicia, we'll go this way next.

09:10.350 --> 09:11.970
O-Okay...

09:19.380 --> 09:23.290
Um, the monsters seem to be 
getting bigger and bigger...

09:23.520 --> 09:26.860
The deeper we go, the stronger 
the monsters will be.

09:26.860 --> 09:28.920
That's the real thrill of dungeons.

09:29.170 --> 09:31.340
I don't need that kind of thrill!

09:36.490 --> 09:39.450
This dungeon goes down fifty floors,

09:39.450 --> 09:43.360
and it gives you reward items at random.

09:43.360 --> 09:45.180
Let's look forward to that.

09:45.180 --> 09:45.600
What?

09:45.850 --> 09:47.850
Fifty floors?!

09:54.340 --> 09:57.780
From here, monsters of attributes 
other than dark will show up.

09:57.780 --> 10:01.780
Be sure to identify each opponent's 
weaknesses and skills.

10:01.780 --> 10:04.260
Why aren't you helping me, Miss Yumiella?!

10:04.260 --> 10:07.000
Because I'd get in the 
way of your leveling...

10:07.880 --> 10:09.280
Don't worry.

10:09.280 --> 10:12.000
If I think you're in danger, I'll...

10:13.510 --> 10:14.930
back you up.

10:14.930 --> 10:16.920
I'm still going to worry!

10:26.310 --> 10:29.190
Huh? Wh-What just...

10:29.190 --> 10:33.400
You leveled up and gained the 
ability to use a new spell.

10:33.950 --> 10:35.830
Let's keep it up.

10:47.860 --> 10:49.160
You're doing great!

10:53.480 --> 10:56.030
<i>This is a pleasure I can't experience anymore</i>

10:56.030 --> 10:57.930
<i>now that my level's maxed out.</i>

10:58.370 --> 10:59.630
<i>I envy her.</i>

11:01.180 --> 11:06.180
Oh, yeah. I forgot there was a pitfall here.

11:08.460 --> 11:10.190
Ow...

11:21.550 --> 11:23.530
Miss Alicia, are you all right?

11:24.150 --> 11:24.830
Yes...

11:25.240 --> 11:28.290
I killed the monster, but I—

11:30.210 --> 11:32.500
I'll use a healing spell on you.

11:33.030 --> 11:36.000
Huh? That's okay... I can use my own...

11:36.230 --> 11:37.680
No need to be shy.

11:37.680 --> 11:40.100
It's my apology for forgetting 
about that pitfall.

11:49.040 --> 11:52.480
We've made it to the fiftieth 
floor, and the final enemy.

11:52.850 --> 11:54.270
I am impressed.

11:54.570 --> 11:59.870
I never expected a human to reach 
the deepest depths of my dungeon.

12:01.580 --> 12:03.320
Start by just doing the best you can.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.990
I don't want to die... I don't want to die...

12:05.240 --> 12:08.870
Foolish adventurers! Come at me!

12:09.240 --> 12:10.090
Go on.

12:12.720 --> 12:15.210
I'm sorry. I forgot my own strength.

12:20.170 --> 12:21.260
Miss Alicia!

12:21.510 --> 12:23.380
Grandma!

12:25.910 --> 12:27.430
I don't want to die!

12:27.770 --> 12:28.890
Sun Rain!

12:31.870 --> 12:33.910
What? It didn't do anything?

12:33.910 --> 12:37.170
I don't think that spell 
has any offensive power.

12:39.310 --> 12:42.030
Is that all the strength you've got?

12:48.530 --> 12:51.730
Maybe it's too soon for her 
to handle a boss on her own.

12:53.440 --> 12:55.650
Yumiella Punch!

13:04.630 --> 13:05.930
Miss Alicia!

13:14.180 --> 13:17.350
It's all right. I finished off the boss.

13:17.630 --> 13:20.600
It looks like the Amulet 
of Protection saved you.

13:22.420 --> 13:26.110
It only works once, though, so you 
won't be able to use it again.

13:26.650 --> 13:29.540
Now, let's open the treasure chest.

13:30.090 --> 13:32.120
We can look forward to seeing what's in it.

13:35.130 --> 13:38.330
Luck is definitely on your side, Miss Alicia.

13:39.020 --> 13:40.950
Its a set of Amulets of Protection.

13:41.340 --> 13:44.570
I don't need them, so you can have them.

13:45.340 --> 13:47.050
Thank you.

13:50.110 --> 13:51.710
Wh-What is this?

13:51.710 --> 13:53.350
The light of transportation.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.940
This dungeon automatically

13:54.940 --> 13:57.850
transports you back to the surface 
once you've conquered it.

14:06.950 --> 14:11.440
Thanks, Miss Yumiella. I don't 
know how to express my gratitude.

14:11.440 --> 14:14.010
Okay, you've had a potion.

14:14.010 --> 14:17.250
Put on another Amulet of Protection, 
and we'll go in again.

14:17.250 --> 14:18.210
Huh?

14:19.150 --> 14:23.130
You haven't beaten the boss,
so you can't say you've conquered it.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.500
Besides...

14:24.930 --> 14:28.000
You might as well raise your 
level as high as you can.

14:33.020 --> 14:34.610
I am impressed.

14:34.970 --> 14:39.640
I never expected a human to reach 
the deepest depths of my dungeon.

14:39.640 --> 14:44.060
<i>Alicia made several more attempts 
to conquer the dungeon after that.</i>

14:46.790 --> 14:50.120
<i>Her level rose in the most fascinating way,</i>

14:50.120 --> 14:53.720
<i>and she acquired new 
spells one after another.</i>

14:54.140 --> 14:58.200
<i>Just watching someone else get 
so much stronger is exciting...</i>

14:58.680 --> 15:02.590
<i>but there's something abnormal about 
how quickly she's leveling up.</i>

15:02.950 --> 15:06.300
<i>Is this the game plot's driving 
force in action again?</i>

15:09.550 --> 15:11.540
Yumiella Kick!

15:11.930 --> 15:15.930
<i>But she still couldn't manage 
to finish off the boss.</i>

15:18.410 --> 15:20.190
I don't want to die.

15:20.800 --> 15:23.030
<i>The treasure chest she earned 
after several attempts</i>

15:23.030 --> 15:26.690
<i>contained a bastard sword 
of the dark attribute.</i>

15:27.450 --> 15:31.190
<i>Since Alicia's attribute is light, 
she'd have trouble using it,</i>

15:31.190 --> 15:33.450
<i>so we agreed that I'd keep it.</i>

15:38.490 --> 15:41.350
<i>We received a wind spear 
at one point, as well.</i>

15:43.040 --> 15:45.340
<i>I'll give this to Patrick as a souvenir.</i>

15:45.580 --> 15:47.090
I am impressed.

15:47.090 --> 15:51.840
I never expected a human to reach 
the deepest depths of my dungeon.

15:54.480 --> 15:55.760
I don't want to die!

16:08.000 --> 16:09.860
<i>And then, finally,</i>

16:10.210 --> 16:12.710
<i>Alicia defeated the boss on her own.</i>

16:14.580 --> 16:17.560
<i>That time, the chest contained a light sword.</i>

16:18.530 --> 16:23.370
<i>This will be a powerful weapon in 
her battle against the Demon Lord.</i>

16:24.080 --> 16:24.870
Ow!

16:25.770 --> 16:28.880
<i>It looks like it reacts to dark magic.</i>

16:29.690 --> 16:33.020
<i>Even the sword thinks I'm the 
Demon Lord. Now I'm just sad.</i>

16:35.180 --> 16:36.920
We've achieved our goal.

16:37.410 --> 16:39.530
I think that's enough for today.

16:40.800 --> 16:45.310
Well, Miss Alicia? Do you see 
how fun leveling up is now?

16:45.730 --> 16:50.480
Grandpa? But you died five years ago...

16:50.820 --> 16:55.320
What? I'm not ready for this place yet?

16:59.510 --> 17:02.120
We still have time before curfew.

17:02.350 --> 17:07.370
Miss Alicia, why don't we go to where 
the Demon Lord is and check things out?

17:08.120 --> 17:12.510
We can still get back to the academy 
before curfew if we fly on Ryu.

17:12.510 --> 17:16.310
D-Don't be crazy!
This isn't a sightseeing trip!

17:17.050 --> 17:21.770
Wait... how do you know 
where the Demon Lord is?

17:22.650 --> 17:26.000
<i>It's actually because I played 
the game so many times...</i>

17:28.590 --> 17:32.400
It's my level 99 instincts. 
Somehow, I just know which way to go.

17:33.170 --> 17:35.780
So we can at least confirm his location.

17:39.700 --> 17:42.410
Do you dislike animals, Miss Alicia?

17:45.670 --> 17:49.900
Come to think of it, you got along 
nicely with that cat a while ago.

17:50.250 --> 17:53.130
Do you dislike high places, then?

17:56.250 --> 17:58.540
Then what are you so afraid of?

18:00.220 --> 18:02.470
Wh-Where did this come from?!

18:03.070 --> 18:04.790
A bomb cyclone, maybe?

18:09.730 --> 18:10.520
Ryu.

18:23.310 --> 18:25.440
First a storm, then fog?

18:25.440 --> 18:27.160
What's going on?

18:27.680 --> 18:30.920
Maybe the Demon Lord is trying to stop us.

18:30.920 --> 18:33.270
I don't sense him, though.

18:33.270 --> 18:35.550
This appears to be natural.

18:36.370 --> 18:39.300
Hm? We passed by here earlier...

18:39.790 --> 18:44.680
Ryu, be careful not to go the 
wrong way. Go where I tell you to.

18:52.970 --> 18:55.630
<i>We're just flying around in circles.</i>

18:56.810 --> 18:58.190
<i>This isn't right.</i>

18:59.030 --> 19:02.480
<i>It might be the driving force 
of the game's plot again.</i>

19:03.500 --> 19:08.420
<i>Maybe we can't get close to the Demon 
Lord until it's the right time.</i>

19:09.290 --> 19:11.300
Ryu, let's turn back.

19:12.670 --> 19:15.170
Miss Alicia, we're heading 
back to the academy.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.710
Really?!

19:19.300 --> 19:20.120
Ryu.

19:24.100 --> 19:27.350
It'll be a pain to keep having 
to catch her if we fly back.

19:28.820 --> 19:32.910
Help me!

19:34.810 --> 19:35.650
Look!

19:36.230 --> 19:37.380
What's that?

19:43.830 --> 19:44.990
We've returned.

19:46.550 --> 19:48.470
Miss Alicia is safe.

19:51.960 --> 19:53.030
Alicia!

19:53.900 --> 19:56.330
Ed! Will! Oz!

19:58.810 --> 20:01.380
I was so scared!

20:01.380 --> 20:04.390
You're all right. Thank goodness.

20:04.390 --> 20:07.800
Where were you? We've been worried sick!

20:07.800 --> 20:10.020
Come, now. Don't cry.

20:10.760 --> 20:14.950
Nice job, Yumiella. Where in 
the world did you find her?

20:14.950 --> 20:17.020
It's a long story.

20:17.370 --> 20:19.160
Here. For you.

20:19.160 --> 20:20.780
For me?

20:22.500 --> 20:26.870
Miss Alicia, all of these 
magic stones are yours.

20:26.870 --> 20:28.530
I'll take them for her.

20:28.530 --> 20:30.790
Th-These are heavy!

20:30.790 --> 20:34.010
Miss Yumiella, thank you for finding her.

20:34.010 --> 20:35.430
You have my deepest gratitude.

20:35.430 --> 20:38.780
Your 99 levels saved the day. Thank you.

20:38.780 --> 20:41.050
Thank you, Miss Yumiella!

20:41.540 --> 20:43.890
I didn't do anything deserving of thanks.

20:44.490 --> 20:48.640
More importantly, Ryu is hungry. 
Do you have anything he can—

20:52.580 --> 20:53.640
Alicia!

20:53.640 --> 20:58.130
I guess he's grown fond of you 
in the time we spent together.

21:08.620 --> 21:11.200
Th-That's incredible, Alicia.

21:11.200 --> 21:13.120
She's stronger than us now.

21:13.120 --> 21:16.690
I'd say she's as powerful as a palace mage.

21:18.780 --> 21:20.080
I worked hard!

21:22.310 --> 21:25.390
N-No! We don't have time for this!

21:25.390 --> 21:27.430
We have to get stronger, too.

21:27.430 --> 21:29.720
Or Alicia's gonna leave us behind!

21:30.980 --> 21:34.820
Looks like Miss Alicia 
gained quite a few levels.

21:35.670 --> 21:38.870
I'm pretty sure she's well past level 50 now.

21:38.870 --> 21:41.730
But she's still not strong enough 
to defeat the Demon Lord.

21:42.350 --> 21:46.420
And the higher her level is,
the harder it'll be to reach the next one.

21:46.970 --> 21:48.770
Keep at it, Ed!

21:46.970 --> 21:51.990
So I think I'll take her to 
a harder dungeon next time.

21:52.570 --> 21:56.070
I think you'll make Alicia cry 
again if you say that to her.

21:56.070 --> 22:00.270
It'll be fine. I think she understands 
how fun leveling up is now.

22:02.970 --> 22:04.640
I have to work harder, too.
